d", " perform", " calculations at", " a", " speed that was virtually", " unimagin", "able to", " mechanical", " calculators. Programming", " the", " ENIAC,", " however, was still", " cumbersome", ": it required setting", " switches", ",", " pl", "ugging cables into", " patch", " panels, and carefully", " configuring the machine for", " each problem", ". This", " illustrated", " a", " major", " unresolved", " problem of the era", ": electronic", " speed", " alone", " was", " not enough; the", " machine also", " needed flexible", ", accessible", ",", " and efficient", " programming.\n\nA", " second", " transformation", " was the adoption", " of the **stored", "-program**", " idea", ", most", " clearly", " articulated by", " **John von Ne", "umann** in his", " 194", "5 report on the", " **EDVAC", "**.", " The", " von Neumann model", " proposed that both", " data", " and instructions should be", " stored in the same", " memory and", " that the machine should", " fetch and", " execute instructions sequentially", ". This architecture", ",", " now", " called", " the **von Ne", "umann architecture**, became", " the foundation for", " nearly", " all digital", " computers. Machines", " such as the **", "Manchester Baby** (", "1948", "), the **ED", "SAC** (", "1949", "), and the **", "Ferranti Mark ", "1** (1", "951)", " brought the stored-program", " concept to", " life. The Manchester", " group", ", including", " **Fre", "eman Williams** and", " **Tom Kilburn", "**, demonstrated the first", " working", " stored-program electronic", " computer;", " **", "M", "aurice Wilkes", "** and", " his", " team built", " EDSAC and", " later", " developed **", "E", "AC", "**, helping", " to establish", " the idea", " that", " computers", " could be programmed", " by ordinary", " users rather than by", " hardware specialists", ". This", " shift", " was revolutionary:", " it turned", " the", " computer from a dedicated", " calculator", " into a general", "-purpose symbol", "-processing machine.\n\n", "The early mainframe", " era also created", " the institutional and", " industrial", " structure", " of computing. Companies", " such as **", "IBM**", " and **UN", "IVAC** built", " large", "-scale", " systems", " for scientific", " research, government statistics", ", business", " management", ", and military planning", ". The **UN", "IVAC I**,", " delivered in 1", "951,", " became famous", " partly", " because", " its", " predictions", " were", " used", " in political", " reporting, marking", " one of the first", " moments", " when computers", " entered", " public consciousness. Programming", " languages began", " to evolve, with", " **FOR", "TRAN** becoming", " influential", " for", " scientific computing.", " Memory", " technology", " also", " changed", ":", " **magnetic core", " memory** replaced", " slower", " and", " less reliable storage", " methods, making", " computers faster", ",", " dens", "er, and more", " practical. The long", "-term impact was", " enormous. Computing", " moved", " from experimental", " laboratories into", " universities", ", government", " agencies, and corporations", ",", " creating new", " professions\u2014", "**", "programmers", "**, **systems", " analysts**, **operators", "**\u2014", "and new economic", " activities", " centered", " on data,", " software, and computation", ".\n\n*", " Key technologies and machines", ":\n  *", " **Vacuum tubes", "** and high", "-speed electronic switching\n", "  * **EN", "IAC** and", " early large", "-scale electronic computation\n", "  * **Stored", "-program architecture** and", " the von Neumann", " model\n  *", " **Manchester Baby**,", " **EDSAC", "**, and **Ferr", "anti Mark 1", "**\n  *", " **Magnetic core", " memory**,", " early", " programming", " languages, and commercial", " mainframes\n\n##", " Transistors and", " Miniaturization\n\n", "The invention", " of the **", "transistor** in", " 194", "7 at **", "Bell Labs** by", " **John Bar", "deen**, **W", "alter Brattain", "**, and **William", " Shockley** was", " one of the most", " important", " technological breakthroughs of", " the twentieth century.", " The transistor replaced the", " vacuum tube as", " the", " basic switching element in", " electronic circuits.", " Compared", " with tubes", ", trans", "istors were smaller", ", consumed", " less power, generated", " less heat, and", " were far", " more reliable. This", " was", " not merely", " an incremental", " improvement; it changed", " the physical", " limits", " of what", " computers", " could be. A", " machine", " that might", " once", " have required an", " entire room of", " glowing", " tubes could,", " in", " principle, be shr", "unk to", " a fraction", " of its", " size while", " becoming", " faster", " and more efficient", ". The transistor also", " opened", " the door to portable", " electronics, embedded", " control", " systems, and eventually", " the mass market", " devices", " that would define", " digital", " life.\n\nThe", " first practical", " computers with", " transistors emerged", " in the late", " 195", "0s and early", " 196", "0s,", " and", " their", " impact was immediate", ". Machines", " such as the **", "IBM 70", "90** and", " **IBM 7", "094**", " demonstrated", " that transistor", "ized", " systems", " could be more", " reliable and", " easier to maintain than", " vacuum", "-tube predecessors", ". More", " importantly, the development", " of smaller", " systems", " made", " computing", " accessible beyond", " the largest", " research", " and", " defense", " organizations", ". The **DEC", " PDP-8", "**, introduced", " in 19", "65, is", " often considered", " the first commercially", " successful **minicom", "puter**. It cost", " far", " less than a", " mainframe, occupied", " less", " space, and could", " be used by universities", ", small businesses", ", and engineering", " departments", ". This", " was", " a major", " social and economic shift", ": computing", " was no longer something", " that", " only a", " few institutions could afford", ". It", " began", " to spread", " into", " labs", ", factories, and", " classrooms", ", creating", " a", " broader base", " of users and developers", ". The", " problems", " being", " solved were", " no longer only", " high", "-st", "akes scientific", " calculations", ", but also real", "-time control, process", " monitoring", ", and smaller", "-scale business", " tasks", ".\n\nMini", "aturization also depended", " on advances", " in **", "semiconductor fabrication", "**, particularly", " the **planar", " process**,", " which allowed trans", "istors to be", " produced", " reliably on", " a", " silicon", " surface", " and", " packaged", " into", " smaller", " assemblies", ". **", "Fair", "child Semiconductor", "** and later **", "Intel** became", " central to", " this shift", ", applying", " new", " manufacturing techniques to make", " integrated", " circuits more practical", ". The concept", " of **Moore", "\u2019s Law", "**, articulated", " by **Gordon", " Moore** of", " Intel, observed that", " the", " number of transist", "ors on a chip", " would", " roughly double every two", " years, providing", " a rough", " guide to", " the pace", " of progress", ". Although", " Moore", "\u2019s Law is", " a rule", " of thumb rather than", " a natural", " law, it helped", " shape expectations", " across", " the industry and fueled", " investment in silicon", "-based", " computing. The long", "-term impact was transformative", ": computing", " became cheaper", ", dens", "er, and more", " personal", ", setting", " the stage for the", " integrated", " circuit revolution", " and the rise", " of the", " microcomputer.\n\n", "* Key inventions", " and developments", ":\n  *", " **Transistor**", " and semiconductor", " switching", "\n  * **", "Planar process**", " and scalable", " silicon fabrication", "\n  * **", "Mo", "ore\u2019s Law**", " and exponential", " mini", "aturization\n ", " * **Transistor", "ized mainframes**", " such as the IBM", " 709", "0/70", "94\n ", " * **Minicom", "put", "ers**,", " especially the DEC", " PDP-8", "\n\n## Integrated Circ", "uits and the Micro", "computer Revolution\n\nThe", " **", "integrated circuit**", " (IC) combined", " the transistor", " and", " mini", "aturization into a", " single, powerful", " innovation", ". Independ", "ently conceived", " by", " **Jack Kilby", "** at **", "Texas Instruments** in", " 195", "8 and by **", "Robert Noyce", "** at **Fair", "child Semiconductor** in", " 195", "9, the IC", " placed", " multiple transistors", ",", " resistors, and", " capacitors on a", " single piece", " of semiconductor material.", " Kil", "by\u2019s original", " device", " used german", "ium, while", " Noyce\u2019s", " silicon-based", " design", " became the dominant", " form", " because", " it was", " easier", " to manufacture and package", " at", " scale. The IC", " was", " not", " simply", " a smaller transistor", "; it was a", " new way of building", " electronic systems. By", " placing components", " on a common", " substrate, engineers", " could", " design", " circuits that", " were more reliable", ", faster, and", " far", " less expensive to produce", ". This", " solved one", " of the central problems", " of the transistor", " era: even", " with smaller", " components, wiring", " thousands", " of discrete parts", " together was costly", ", error-prone", ", and difficult", " to scale.\n\n", "The microprocessor", ",", " announced", " in 19", "71 with", " the **Intel ", "4004", "**, pushed", " integration", " even", " further by", " placing the", " core", " logic", " of a central", " processing unit on a", " single chip. The", " 400", "4 was originally", " developed for a Japanese", " calculator company", ", **", "Busicom**,", " but its", " broader", " implications", " were quickly", " recognized.", " Later", " chips such as the", " **Intel 8", "080**", " and", " **Z", "ilog Z", "80**", " made it possible to", " build a", " simple", " but", " powerful", " computer from