"\n  * **", "Integrated circuit** and", " monolithic semiconductor", " design", "\n  * **", "Microprocessor**,", " beginning", " with the Intel ", "4004", "\n  * **", "Altair 8", "800**", " and the hobby", "ist computer movement", "\n  * **", "Apple II**, **", "Commodore**,", " and personal", " computers\n  *", " **BASIC**,", " operating systems, and", " the software", " industry\n\n## Networking", " and the Internet\n\n", "Comput", "ing became", " truly", " global not", " because", " single", " machines became more", " powerful, but because", " machines began to communicate", ". The development", " of **network", "ing** transformed", " computing", " from a collection", " of isolated systems", " into a connected", " infrastructure. One", " of the foundational ideas", " was **packet switching", "**, developed", " independently by **Paul", " Baran** at", " the RAND", " Corporation and **", "Donald Davies** at", " the National", " Physical Laboratory in the", " United", " Kingdom. Packet switching", " proposed that data could", " be divided", " into small packets", ", each", " sent independently through", " a network, and", " then", " reassembled at", " the destination. This", " approach was more", " robust than circuit", " switching", ", which", " reserved", " a", " continuous", " path for the entire", " communication. It", " allowed", " networks to survive", " failures, share bandwidth", " efficiently, and support", " many users", " at once. **", "Leonard Kleinrock", "** provided much", " of the mathematical", " theory behind", " packet-switch", "ed networks, and", " the **", "ARPANET**,", " funded", " by the U.S", ". Department of Defense", "\u2019s Advanced Research Projects", " Agency, became the", " first large", "-scale working", " implementation", ".\n\nThe technical", " architecture that", " made", " the Internet what", " it is", " was", " formal", "ized through", " the development of **", "TCP/IP**", " (**", "Transmission Control Protocol /", " Internet Proto