in", " a person", "\u2019s hand?\n\n", "The smartphone transformed", " mobile", " computing by", " combining", " a", " computer", ", a phone", ", a camera,", " a sensor", " suite", ", and a network", " connection", " into a single personal", " device. The **", "iPhone**, launched", " by **", "Apple** in ", "2007", ", became", " a defining example because", " it combined", " a high", "-resolution touchscreen, a", " full", " web browser, an", " application", " platform", ", and an", " ecosystem of third", "-party software", ". The **App", " Store**, introduced in", " 200", "8, created a", " new market for software", " distribution and turned", " the", " smartphone into a platform", " for developers.", " Compet", "ing", " ecosystems", ", especially", " Android", "-based devices, expanded", " the reach", " of smartphones", " worldwide", ". Smartphones", " also", " integrated **", "GPS**, **accel", "erometers**, **", "gyroscopes**,", " **microphones**,", " and", " **cameras**,", " turning", " the", " device into a sensor", "-rich", " assistant", " for", " location, navigation", ", health, media", ", and communication.", " The long", "-term impact was to", " make computing", " continuously", " available, turning", " the", " phone", " into a default", " interface", " to", " information", ", services, and", " social life.\n\n", "Mobile", " computing also", " changed industry", " and society in profound", " ways. It", " enabled new", " forms of commerce", ", including", " mobile", " payments, ride", "-sharing, on", "-demand services", ", and social", " media", ". It changed", " work by", " allowing communication", " and", " collaboration to occur", " anywhere", ", and", " it resh", "aped media", " consumption,", " health", " monitoring", ", education", ", and civic", " participation", ". At", " the same time,", " it introduced", " serious", " problems", ": privacy", ", data", " security, digital", " addiction, information", " manipulation", ", and unequal", " access.", " The smartphone", " became a symbol", " of both", " the", " promise", " and the risks", " of connected", " computing. For", " the first time in", " history", ", a", " large portion", " of the world\u2019s", " population carried in", " their pockets", " a device that could", " access", " more", " information than a university", " student", " might", " have had even", " a generation", " earlier. This", " shift", " made mobile", " networks", ",", " operating", " systems, and application", " platforms", " as", " important as the hardware", " itself.\n\n*", " Key technologies and devices", ":\n  *", " **Mobile phone**", " and cellular", " tele", "phony\n  *", " **GSM**", " and digital mobile", " networks", "\n  * **", "Smartphone** and", " touchscreen interaction", "\n  * **", "App stores", "** and platform", "-based software ecosystems", "\n  * **", "GPS**, sensors", ", cameras", ", and mobile internet", " access", "\n\n## Cloud Computing", "\n\n**", "Cloud computing** emerged", " as", " a", " new", " way to", " deliver computing resources", " on", " demand, treating", " computation", ",", " storage, and software", " as services", " that", " could", " be accessed", " over", " a network.", " Its", " roots go", " back to the early", " mainframe era,", " when time", "-sharing systems", " allowed multiple users to", " share a single machine", ", and to", " later ideas", " in", " **grid computing**", " and **utility computing", "**.", " However", ", the modern", " cloud became practical with", " advances", " in virtual", "ization, large", "-scale data centers,", " high-speed networking,", " and automated", " resource", " management. In", " 200", "6, **Amazon", " Web Services** launched", " **EC", "2** (**", "Elastic Compute Cloud", "**) and **S", "3**", " (**Simple Storage Service", "**), offering", " developers", " and companies", " the ability to rent", " virtual servers", " and storage over", " the Internet", ". This was", " a watershed", " moment: computing", " capacity", " was", " no longer something", " you", " had to buy and", " manage", " physically; it could", " be requested", ", scaled, and", " paid", " for as needed.", "\n\nThe cloud", " created", " several", " distinct", " service models, including", " **I", "aaS** (**", "Infrastructure as a Service", "**), **PaaS", "** (**Platform as", " a Service**), and", " **SaaS**", " (**Software as a", " Service**). I", "aaS provided", " virtual machines and", " storage; P", "aaS provided platforms for", " building", " and deploying", " applications; SaaS", " delivered complete", " applications", " over", " the web.", " Companies such as **", "Amazon**, **Microsoft", "**, **Google**,", " **Salesforce**,", " **", "Heroku**, and", " **Oracle** built", " platforms", " that allowed", " developers to create", ",", " test, and run", " applications", " without owning", " the underlying hardware.", " This solved many", " practical problems: capital", " expenditure, server", " maintenance", ", scaling", " for", " unexpected", " demand", ", disaster", " recovery, and global", " distribution", ". For", " startups especially", ", the cloud was", " transformative because it lowered", " the cost", " of entry.", " A small", " team could launch", " a globally", " distributed service without", " first", " building a data", " center.\n\nThe", " long-term impact of", " cloud computing was", " to make", " the physical", " details", " of infrastructure", " largely invisible to", " most", " users and", " businesses", ". Streaming", " video", ", social media,", " online", " gaming", ", financial", " services", ", healthcare", " records", ", and enterprise software", " increasingly", " depend on cloud", " back", " ends", ". The cloud also", " enabled new", " forms", " of artificial", " intelligence, because", " training", " large models requires", " enormous amounts of compute", " and storage that are", " difficult", " to acquire", " locally. At", " the same time,", " cloud computing raised important", " concerns", " about data", " sovereignty", ", security, vendor", " lock-in, energy", " consumption, and environmental", " sustainability", ". The problems", " being solved were now", " systemic", ": how to manage", " massive", " distributed", " systems, ensure", " availability", ", control", " cost", ", and protect", " data", " at", " global", " scale. The cloud", " became the", " backbone", " of the", " modern", " digital economy, shifting", " power", " and", " complexity", " from individual", " machines to managed", " platforms.\n\n*", " Key technologies and services", ":\n  *", " **Virtualization**", " and resource abstraction\n", "  * **Amazon", " EC", "2**", " and **S3", "**\n  *", " **IaaS**,", " **PaaS**,", " and **SaaS", "** models", "\n  * **", "Data centers** and", " distributed", " cloud", " infrastructure\n  *", " **E", "lastic scaling", "**,", " **", "multi", "-tenancy**,", " and managed", " services", "\n\n## Artificial Intelligence", " and Machine Learning\n\n", "**Artificial intelligence", "** (AI)", " is the field", " concerned", " with building", " machines that can perform", " tasks associated", " with human", " intelligence, such as", " reasoning, learning,", " perception, language", ",", " and decision-making.", " Although", " the history", " of AI began", " well", " before modern", " computing", ", the field", " became", " formally organized in ", "1956", " at the **D", "artmouth Conference**,", " where **", "John", " McCarthy**, **Mar", "vin Minsky**,", " **Claude Shannon**,", " **", "Nath", "aniel Rochester", "**, and others helped", " define the discipline", ". Early AI", " was largely", " **", "symbolic**, focusing", " on logic", ", rule", "-based systems", ", and search.", " Systems", " such as **", "ELIZA** demonstrated", " simple", " pattern", "-m", "atching in", " conversation", ", while **", "expert systems** attempted", " to capture", " specialized", " knowledge from", " human", " experts.", " These", " early systems revealed", " both", " the