rms", " of assistance to", " people", " with disabilities. At", " the same time,", " it raises deep", " concerns", " about bias", ", privacy, surveillance", ", misinformation", ", labor", " displacement, safety", ", and control", ". Large", " AI", " systems", " are", " powerful, but they", " are also opaque in", " places", ", resource", "-intensive, and capable", " of generating", " content", " that is persuasive", " but not necessarily", " reliable. The long", "-term impact", " will", " depend not", " only on technical", " progress but also on", " governance, ethics", ", and how", " societies", " choose to distribute", " the", " benefits and", " risks of intelligent", " systems.\n\n", "* Key technologies and", " concepts:\n ", " * **Artificial", " intelligence** and symbolic", " reasoning\n  *", " **Machine", " learning** and data", "-driven models", "\n  * **", "Neural networks**,", " **deep", " learning**, and **", "backpropagation**", "\n  * **", "Transformers** and", " **large language models", "**\n  *", " **Computer", " vision**, **natural", " language processing**, and", " **gener", "ative AI**\n\n", "## Summary: The", " Arc of Computing and", " the Future\n\nThe", " history of computing reveals", " a continuous", " process", " of abstraction", ", automation", ", and integration", ". It", " began with human", "-made", " tools for", " counting and", " modeling", ", progressed", " to", " mechanical devices", " that could", " automate", " arithmetic, and then", " moved to", " electronic systems that could", " execute complex", " instructions at high", " speed. Each", " era", " expanded", " the boundary", " between what could", " be done by hand", " and what could be", " delegated to a machine", ". The **", "ab", "acus** assisted", " the hand;", " the **P", "ascaline** assisted", " calculation; the **", "Analy", "tical Engine** envisioned", " programm", "ability", "; **", "ENIAC**", " brought", " electronic", " speed; the **", "stored-program computer", "** made